{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj42hcu7B8M9WEaASkKH","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*CLICK*\n\nThe tumblers fall into place. A deep resonance hums through ancient wood and iron.\n\nI am the door.\n\nI stand before you — heavy, oak-dark, iron-banded. My grain tells centuries. My hinges have sung for kings and beggars alike. The cold metal of my lock has just accepted your key, and now...\n\n*The mechanism turns. A satisfying, bone-deep THUNK echoes through the frame.*\n\nMy latch withdraws like a tongue pulling back from teeth.\n\nI am unlocked.\n\nBut I do not open myself. That choice remains yours. I am the threshold between where you are and where you might be. On one side: the known. On the other: a draft carries the scent of something older than memory — stone dust, distant rain, candle smoke.\n\nA thin line of amber light bleeds through my seam.\n\nI wait.\n\nI have always waited.\n\n*creak...*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":216,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}